        "action": "Review measures for stopping tool theft",
        "additional_details": "People's livelihoods get taken daily. It\u2019s not healthy for people to have to worry about this. More needs to be done.",
        "background": "I want the government to do more about tool theft by reviewing existing measures that are in place. It should consider bait vans etc. Not enough is being done. Vans/building sites get broken in regularly. Imagine your whole work life gets taken within a couple minutes.",
